// First-party art: sprites drawn for this game rather than ported from
// tgstation. Paths are relative to `tfs/assets/originals/`, and the
// extension picks the decoder — `.png` is one 32x32 still, `.aseprite`
// is a tagged document whose TAGS are its states. Contract and the
// authoring rules: `tfs/assets/originals/README.md`, docs/ASSETS.md §4.1.
//
// One family of `tfs/assets/sprites.ron`'s roster. Every .ron in
// this directory is baked, in FILE-NAME order and then entry order,
// so the atlas layout is a function of the manifest and not of the
// filesystem. Two files claiming one sprite name is a bake error.
(
    sprites: [
        // A bar of soap: the same drawing three ways, which is exactly
        // what makes it a proof — one still from a plain PNG, one still
        // from an Aseprite tag, and one animation from a tagged range.
        ("soap_bar", Png("soap.png")),
        ("soap_wet", Ase("soap.aseprite", "idle")),
        ("soap_bubbles", AseAnim("soap.aseprite", "bubbles")),
    ],
)
